[statement]
A `!` entry in the request forbids what a requested package depends on, and
apk refuses rather than install the package without it: `app` needs `lib`,
and the request states `!lib`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:lib

P:lib
V:1

[request]
app
!lib

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   lib-1:
|     breaks: world[!lib]
|     satisfies: app-1[lib]
refused
